                "accordion_row_rp001": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Returns Policy",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_rp001": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<h5><strong>Final Sale</strong></h5><p>Your vest is <strong>final sale. We are not able to accept returns or exchanges. </strong>Please check the size chart before you choose your size, and double check your custom text before completing your order. We embroider exactly what you submit, and we are not responsible for misspellings or incorrectly entered names or details. Review our <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\" title=\"Refund Policy\">Refund / Return policy</a> for full details.</p><h5><strong>Defects or Our Errors</strong></h5><p>If something arrives damaged or defective, we'll make it right. See our <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\" title=\"Refund Policy\">Refund & Return Policy</a> for how to reach us and what to expect.</p>",
